{
    "title": "World of Tanks Blitz\u2122",
    "description": "It's World of Tanks Blitz, a legendary action-adventure tank game. Blitz is not about war, but tanks! Join this action-packed PvP shooter and explore unique vehicles and a variety of battlefields. Experience the adrenaline rush of intense tank battles that test your skills and strategy. Join the fray in this action-packed adventure of vehicle combat games!\r\n\r\n This FREE tank game keeps you engaged and brings everyday challenges and unique events. Breaking away from conventional war games, Blitz offers a singular focus on the adrenaline-fueled thrill of a tank game! Immerse yourself in this dynamic PvP shooter, where you'll navigate a landscape brimming with diverse vehicles, sprawling battlefields, and monumental tank warfare.\r\n \r\n UPGRADE YOUR TANKS\r\n Choose from more than 400 vehicles, ranging from Tier I to sophisticated Tier X machines, and command a massive army of battle tanks to dominate the battlefield! Pump up your metal beasts in the Garage to enjoy this PvP action game! \r\n\r\n AND FANTASY VEHICLES TOO\r\n Test experimental vehicles brought to life from the blueprints of famous engineers to feel extra special! Customize your combat vehicles and have fun, but not war!\r\n \r\n USE YOUR TANKS\u2019 ADVANTAGES IN BATTLE\r\n In every battle, each tank presents distinct gameplay mechanics. The various shapes of hulls and turrets can deflect even the most powerful shells. This adds depth to the tank simulator experience and enriches the gameplay dynamics of the vehicle combat game.\r\n \r\n WIN REWARDS\r\n Enjoy in-game events inspired by monsters, dinosaurs, cartoons, musicians, and other game universes! Complete your special missions for rewards to upgrade your favorite vehicles in World of Tanks Blitz.\r\n \r\n FIGHT IN 30+ BATTLE ARENAS\r\n Shooting games are never boring, and tank battles are no exception. Discover a variety of battlefield arenas with their unique features and machines. Avoid the heat in a sunbaked desert, study ancient ruins in the Mediterranean, or crawl through a dark and dim secret base lost in time. But that\u2019s not all! Launch your war of tanks on the Moon in low gravity or surprise your enemies with mystical abilities like rising from the dead.\r\n \r\n PLAY IN A TEAM AND WIN TOURNAMENTS\r\n You never play alone! Join clans and play with friends in World of Tanks Blitz. Build your own platoon, roll into battle as a team, and compete for glory, high rankings, or prizes! WoT Blitz is cross-platform, enabling thunderous tank warfare across various devices.\r\n \r\n DRIVE HISTORICAL VEHICLES\r\n Drive and upgrade historically accurate tanks and tank destroyers from Germany, France, Japan, Great Britain, China, the USSR, the USA, and other nations.\r\n \r\n OPTIMIZED GFX FOR ANY DEVICE\r\n This PvP shooter is automatically optimized for your device. Get the most out of driving exciting tank models, and watch massive explosions and spectacular blown-off turrets flying around a battle arena. Go to the settings of WOTB to find the balance between fantastic visuals and high FPS.\r\n \r\n World of Tanks Blitz is a living tank universe that never stops evolving. Join the world of shooting games, where precision, strategy, and reflexes are put to the test in combat scenarios. Upgrade your combat vehicles and command an army of tanks! Experience the thrill of vehicle combat games as you commandeer powerful tanks and strategize your way to victory! Hurry up to enter this tank game and roll out into battle!\r\n \r\n 2024 Wargaming.net",
    "descriptionHTML": "It&#39;s World of Tanks Blitz, a legendary action-adventure tank game. Blitz is not about war, but tanks! Join this action-packed PvP shooter and explore unique vehicles and a variety of battlefields. Experience the adrenaline rush of intense tank battles that test your skills and strategy. Join the fray in this action-packed adventure of vehicle combat games!<br><br> This FREE tank game keeps you engaged and brings everyday challenges and unique events. Breaking away from conventional war games, Blitz offers a singular focus on the adrenaline-fueled thrill of a tank game! Immerse yourself in this dynamic PvP shooter, where you&#39;ll navigate a landscape brimming with diverse vehicles, sprawling battlefields, and monumental tank warfare.<br> <br> UPGRADE YOUR TANKS<br> Choose from more than 400 vehicles, ranging from Tier I to sophisticated Tier X machines, and command a massive army of battle tanks to dominate the battlefield! Pump up your metal beasts in the Garage to enjoy this PvP action game! <br><br> AND FANTASY VEHICLES TOO<br> Test experimental vehicles brought to life from the blueprints of famous engineers to feel extra special! Customize your combat vehicles and have fun, but not war!<br> <br> USE YOUR TANKS\u2019 ADVANTAGES IN BATTLE<br> In every battle, each tank presents distinct gameplay mechanics. The various shapes of hulls and turrets can deflect even the most powerful shells. This adds depth to the tank simulator experience and enriches the gameplay dynamics of the vehicle combat game.<br> <br> WIN REWARDS<br> Enjoy in-game events inspired by monsters, dinosaurs, cartoons, musicians, and other game universes! Complete your special missions for rewards to upgrade your favorite vehicles in World of Tanks Blitz.<br> <br> FIGHT IN 30+ BATTLE ARENAS<br> Shooting games are never boring, and tank battles are no exception. Discover a variety of battlefield arenas with their unique features and machines. Avoid the heat in a sunbaked desert, study ancient ruins in the Mediterranean, or crawl through a dark and dim secret base lost in time. But that\u2019s not all! Launch your war of tanks on the Moon in low gravity or surprise your enemies with mystical abilities like rising from the dead.<br> <br> PLAY IN A TEAM AND WIN TOURNAMENTS<br> You never play alone! Join clans and play with friends in World of Tanks Blitz. Build your own platoon, roll into battle as a team, and compete for glory, high rankings, or prizes! WoT Blitz is cross-platform, enabling thunderous tank warfare across various devices.<br> <br> DRIVE HISTORICAL VEHICLES<br> Drive and upgrade historically accurate tanks and tank destroyers from Germany, France, Japan, Great Britain, China, the USSR, the USA, and other nations.<br> <br> OPTIMIZED GFX FOR ANY DEVICE<br> This PvP shooter is automatically optimized for your device. Get the most out of driving exciting tank models, and watch massive explosions and spectacular blown-off turrets flying around a battle arena. Go to the settings of WOTB to find the balance between fantastic visuals and high FPS.<br> <br> World of Tanks Blitz is a living tank universe that never stops evolving. Join the world of shooting games, where precision, strategy, and reflexes are put to the test in combat scenarios. Upgrade your combat vehicles and command an army of tanks! Experience the thrill of vehicle combat games as you commandeer powerful tanks and strategize your way to victory! Hurry up to enter this tank game and roll out into battle!<br> <br> 2024 Wargaming.net",
    "summary": "Modern tank PVP shooter with action and fun! Prioritisig strategy over war!",
